    "offline": "The feed URL and the Bluesky handle and app password are placeholders in the template; the overlay fills them on both sides. In n8n's manual mode the RSS Feed Trigger reads the whole feed and emits only its first item (FIXTURES.md); trigger.items is that item as rss-parser gives it. Create Post's JSON body splices contentSnippet raw into a JSON string and reads link title from a misspelt field (lintitlek), so its embed title is empty on both sides by the template's own construction."
